#                                   and `backdrop-filter`
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/StyleValues/FilterValueListStyleValue.cpp (lines 1-151) and the inline
#       members of FilterValueListStyleValue.h: the FilterOperation structs (blur(),
#       drop-shadow(), hue-rotate() and the color filters) and the list's serialization and
#       absolutization. The structs' defaulted operator== are css_filter_values_equal.
